9. `findings` — `conflict` (two design fields disagree about something the image must show), `gap` (an identity part lacks the data to draw it correctly), `ambiguity` (a term can be drawn more than one way) or `camera` (a camera cannot show what it is meant to show). Severity `blocking` when the image cannot be drawn correctly until a person fixes the design, otherwise `note`. Name the refs involved.

### Rules

