- Leave out interior rooms, interior materials and lighting, operating procedures, engineering studies and regulations unless they fix an exterior shape.
- Keep port and starboard exactly as the coordinate system defines them (y positive is port). Do not assume symmetry the design does not state.
- Say each thing once, in the block where it belongs. Compact sentences; no quality adjectives.
- Return only the JSON object.
