- `script.beats` is the only source of each beat’s reveal level and emotion; do not write `story.reveal_plan` or `story.emotion_curve` — code builds them from `beats[].reveal` and `beats[].emotion` and stores them under those names for Phases 4M, 7A and 9H. Every beat named anywhere in `story` exists in `script.beats`.
